{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 9735752892700185264,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Rabin-Karp Algorithm for string matching",
      "source_hash": 16443588116421804567,
      "context_hash": 13971664167734297641,
      "translation": "문자열 매칭을 위한 Rabin-Karp 알고리즘",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "matching": "매칭"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:48:57.496020Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This algorithm is based on the concept of hashing, so if you are not familiar with string hashing, refer to the [string hashing](string-hashing.md) article.",
      "source_hash": 5695931519017287572,
      "context_hash": 6450728456332602754,
      "translation": "이 알고리즘은 해싱 개념에 기반하므로, 문자열 해싱에 익숙하지 않다면 [문자열 해싱](string-hashing.md) 문서를 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:48:57.496020Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "This algorithm was authored by Rabin and Karp in 1987.",
      "source_hash": 5037240799634675222,
      "context_hash": 2730650823438082740,
      "translation": "이 알고리즘은 1987년에 Rabin과 Karp가 고안했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:48:57.496021Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Problem: Given two strings - a pattern $s$ and a text $t$, determine if the pattern appears in the text and if it does, enumerate all its occurrences in $O(|s| + |t|)$ time.",
      "source_hash": 10713241399779012662,
      "context_hash": 4109735491247105193,
      "translation": "문제: 패턴 $s$와 텍스트 $t$라는 두 문자열이 주어질 때, 패턴이 텍스트에 나타나는지 판별하고, 나타난다면 모든 등장 위치를 $O(|s| + |t|)$ 시간에 열거하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:48:57.496021Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Algorithm: Calculate the hash for the pattern $s$.",
      "source_hash": 5327535018985347967,
      "context_hash": 6343963059805590112,
      "translation": "알고리즘: 패턴 $s$의 해시를 계산합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:48:57.496021Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "Calculate hash values for all the prefixes of the text $t$.",
      "source_hash": 1719135072431111889,
      "context_hash": 601327225804677987,
      "translation": "텍스트 $t$의 모든 접두사에 대한 해시 값을 계산합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:48:57.496021Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:2",
      "source": "Now, we can compare a substring of length $|s|$ with $s$ in constant time using the calculated hashes.",
      "source_hash": 423596628907153242,
      "context_hash": 10264246888651699743,
      "translation": "이제 계산한 해시를 이용하면 길이가 $|s|$인 부분 문자열을 $s$와 상수 시간에 비교할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:48:57.496021Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:3",
      "source": "So, compare each substring of length $|s|$ with the pattern.",
      "source_hash": 3819798489847748742,
      "context_hash": 10467685499635726849,
      "translation": "따라서 길이가 $|s|$인 각 부분 문자열을 패턴과 비교합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:48:57.496021Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:4",
      "source": "This will take a total of $O(|t|)$ time.",
      "source_hash": 16926514088800349936,
      "context_hash": 8060877716168706640,
      "translation": "이 과정에는 총 $O(|t|)$ 시간이 걸립니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:48:57.496021Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:5",
      "source": "Hence the final complexity of the algorithm is $O(|t| + |s|)$: $O(|s|)$ is required for calculating the hash of the pattern and $O(|t|)$ for comparing each substring of length $|s|$ with the pattern.",
      "source_hash": 14100367593564926179,
      "context_hash": 2372941284172609280,
      "translation": "따라서 알고리즘의 최종 복잡도는 $O(|t| + |s|)$입니다. 패턴의 해시를 계산하는 데 $O(|s|)$가 필요하고, 길이가 $|s|$인 각 부분 문자열을 패턴과 비교하는 데 $O(|t|)$가 필요합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "complexity": "복잡도"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:48:57.496021Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
